{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"形式圆盘"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"形式圆盘"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于域 $k$ 与 $k$-代数 $R$, 定义形式圆盘\n$$\r\nD_R = \\operatorname{Spec} R[[t]].\r\n$$\n注意这是"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"而不是"},{"Local":{"url":"形式概形","text":"形式概形"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Spf}R[[t]]$.</p>\n"}]}}